    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f BoB - Battle of Bots</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot <strong>BOB</strong> - Humanity's last hope in a postapocalyptic scrapyard showdown against endless mechanical mayhem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>BoB - Battle of Bots</strong>, an adrenaline-fueled, action-packed survival game where your reflexes, strategy, and upgrades are the only things standing between humanity and the rise of rogue machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the pilot seat as Helena, controlling BOB, a battle-hardened Mecha built from scavenged parts. Together, you\u2019ll fight to protect the ancient city of Trier from endless waves of robotic enemies. Level up, unlock powerful abilities, and see how long you can survive in this thrilling bot-bashing arena.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 The Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the wreckage of Trier\u2019s once-thriving industrial sector, an army of corrupted bots rises. Their goal? Total annihilation. But  BOB \u2014 and his fearless pilot Helena won\u2019t go down without a fight. As the city\u2019s last line of defense, you must stand strong, upgrade fast, and keep moving or risk being overwhelmed and turned to smoking scrap!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 Endless Waves of Enemies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a relentless onslaught of varied enemy bots in a fast-paced, wave-based survival mode. Each wave gets harder but more enemies also mean more XP \u2014 How long can you last?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800110/extras/56f2bbda5028d023558b78e9bb9060d0.poster.avif?t=1750624792\" width=648 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800110/extras/56f2bbda5028d023558b78e9bb9060d0.webm?t=1750624792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800110/extras/56f2bbda5028d023558b78e9bb9060d0.mp4?t=1750624792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f Unlock Powerful Abilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain XP with every bot you destroy. Choose between new abilities, weapons or passive skill upgrades to create your own unstoppable build and fight style. Every run is different!\u00a0Whether it\u2019s devastating AoE attacks or life-saving defensive skills, build a loadout that suits your style and turns the battlefield in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800110/extras/4ec709dac46662b965bbebe624b89640.poster.avif?t=1750624792\" width=648 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800110/extras/4ec709dac46662b965bbebe624b89640.webm?t=1750624792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800110/extras/4ec709dac46662b965bbebe624b89640.mp4?t=1750624792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 Survive brutal Boss Battles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not just small fire that threatens BOB's survival - Battle of Bots features a set of terrifyingly tanky Boss Bots that will make even seasoned ace pilots sweat! Whether you are facing the Spikey Spinner or the Mother of Spiders, without some serious upgrades, your chances of survival are slim!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800110/extras/c3d28e040a44498a5466c5162901e475.poster.avif?t=1750624792\" width=648 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800110/extras/c3d28e040a44498a5466c5162901e475.webm?t=1750624792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800110/extras/c3d28e040a44498a5466c5162901e475.mp4?t=1750624792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Coming Soon: Mech Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize BOB\u2019s look and loadout! New visual styles, weapons, and ability slots will let you create the ultimate bot-battling machine. (Coming in a future update!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 Are You Ready to Face the Challenge?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the strongest will survive. Will you rise through the chaos and become the ultimate bot-slaying legend?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the fight. Level. Upgrade. Survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the Battle of Bots.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Add BoB to your Wishlist now and join the resistance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f BoB - Battle of Bots</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot <strong>BOB</strong> - Humanity's last hope in a postapocalyptic scrapyard showdown against endless mechanical mayhem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>BoB - Battle of Bots</strong>, an adrenaline-fueled, action-packed survival game where your reflexes, strategy, and upgrades are the only things standing between humanity and the rise of rogue machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the pilot seat as Helena, controlling BOB, a battle-hardened Mecha built from scavenged parts. Together, you\u2019ll fight to protect the ancient city of Trier from endless waves of robotic enemies. Level up, unlock powerful abilities, and see how long you can survive in this thrilling bot-bashing arena.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 The Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the wreckage of Trier\u2019s once-thriving industrial sector, an army of corrupted bots rises. Their goal? Total annihilation. But  BOB \u2014 and his fearless pilot Helena won\u2019t go down without a fight. As the city\u2019s last line of defense, you must stand strong, upgrade fast, and keep moving or risk being overwhelmed and turned to smoking scrap!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 Endless Waves of Enemies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a relentless onslaught of varied enemy bots in a fast-paced, wave-based survival mode. Each wave gets harder but more enemies also mean more XP \u2014 How long can you last?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800110/extras/56f2bbda5028d023558b78e9bb9060d0.poster.avif?t=1750624792\" width=648 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steam