uted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800110/extras/c3d28e040a44498a5466c5162901e475.poster.avif?t=1750624792\" width=648 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800110/extras/c3d28e040a44498a5466c5162901e475.webm?t=1750624792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800110/extras/c3d28e040a44498a5466c5162901e475.mp4?t=1750624792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Coming Soon: Mech Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize BOB\u2019s look and loadout! New visual styles, weapons, and ability slots will let you create the ultimate bot-battling machine. (Coming in a future update!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 Are You Ready to Face the Challenge?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the strongest will survive. Will you rise through the chaos and become the ultimate bot-slaying legend?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the fight. Level. Upgrade. Survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the Battle of Bots.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Add BoB to your Wishlist now and join the resistance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to BOB, an adrenaline-pumping, action-packed game where your skills are the only thing standing between humanity and endless waves of robotic enemies! Your mission is simple: Survive for as long as you can, obliterating waves of enemies and leveling up to unlock new abilities and weapons.",
